msgstr "AI Social Scientist User Guide"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:4
msgid ""
"**AI Social Scientist** 是 AgentSociety 2 的交互式研究助手，通过 VS Code "
"扩展提供模型配置、后端管理和研究项目入口。可以使用在线工作空间，也可以在本地安装。"
msgstr ""
"**AI Social Scientist** is AgentSociety 2's interactive research assistant. Its VS Code extension"
" provides model configuration, backend management, and research project tools. Use an online "
"workspace or install it locally."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:6
msgid "首次使用时，先选择在线或本地入口，再完成模型与后端配置。项目初始化后，可以管理文献、技能、假设与实验，并查看分析报告。"
msgstr ""
"Choose an online or local setup first, then configure your models and backend. After initializing"
" a project, manage literature, skills, hypotheses, and experiments, and inspect analysis reports."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:8
