#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/cli-gateway.rst:4
msgid "CLI 网关配置"
msgstr "Configure the CLI gateway"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/cli-gateway.rst:6
msgid ""
"**AI Gateway** 是插件内置的本地 HTTP 代理，运行在 ``127.0.0.1:15721-15820`` 端口范围内。它拦截 Claude Code 和 Codex CLI 的"
" API 请求，将其转发到你配置的上游供应商，并自动完成协议格式转换与模型名映射。"
msgstr ""
"The **AI Gateway** is a local HTTP proxy built into the extension, listening on the "
"``127.0.0.1:15721-15820`` port range. It intercepts API requests from Claude Code and the Codex "
"CLI, forwards them to the upstream providers you configure, and transparently converts protocol "
"formats and model names."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/cli-gateway.rst:8
msgid "网关按当前角色和供应商配置转发请求。添加服务前，请核对其接口协议与模型权限。请求流如下："
msgstr ""
"The gateway forwards requests using the selected role and provider configuration. Check the "
"service's protocol and model permissions before adding it. The request flow is shown below:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:176
#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:182
msgid "本地 AI Gateway 请求流"
msgstr "Local AI Gateway request flow"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:184
msgid ""
"从左向右读取：客户端请求进入本地 Gateway，再按当前供应商配置转发。仿真 LLM 的配置单独保存在工作区 ``.env``，不由这条 Claude / Codex "
"路由控制。"
msgstr ""
"Read from left to right: client requests enter the local Gateway, then forward "
"according to the selected provider. Simulation LLM settings are stored separately in "
"workspace ``.env``."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/cli-gateway.rst:20
msgid ""
"Gateway 对 Claude Code 始终呈现一个标准的 Anthropic Messages 端点（``/v1/messages``），对 Codex 始终呈现一个标准的 OpenAI "
"Responses 端点（``/v1/responses``）。因此这两个 CLI 不需要知道背后其实是哪家供应商、哪种协议——Gateway 会在中间完成所有转换。"
msgstr ""
"To Claude Code the Gateway always presents a standard Anthropic Messages endpoint "
"(``/v1/messages``); to Codex it always presents a standard OpenAI Responses endpoint "
"(``/v1/responses``). Neither CLI needs to know which provider or protocol actually sits behind "
"it."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:192
msgid "供应商与路由"
msgstr "Providers and routing"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/cli-gateway.rst:25
msgid "Gateway 提供一个**共享供应商池**——供应商只保存一份，但可以在供应商卡片上分别「激活」到 Claude Code 或 Codex CLI 角色："
msgstr ""
"The Gateway maintains a **shared provider pool** — each provider is stored once, and can be "
"individually *activated* for the Claude Code or Codex CLI role on its provider card:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:197
msgid ""
"**Anthropic 原生供应商** （如 ``api.anthropic.com``、DeepSeek 的 ``/anthropic`` 端点）：直接服务 "
"Claude Code，请求直通转发。"
msgstr ""
"**Native Anthropic providers** (e.g. ``api.anthropic.com``, DeepSeek's ``/anthropic``"
" endpoint): serve Claude Code directly, with requests forwarded as-is."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:198
msgid ""
"**OpenAI 兼容供应商** （如 ``api.openai.com``、智谱 ``paas/v4``、DeepSeek ``/v1``）：可同时服务 Claude "
"Code 和 Codex CLI。 - 服务 Claude Code 时，Gateway 会把 Claude Code 发出的 **Anthropic "
"Messages** 请求实时翻译成 **OpenAI Chat Completions**，再把返回的 SSE 流翻译回去。 - 服务 Codex CLI "
"时，Gateway 会把 Codex 发出的 **OpenAI Responses** 请求翻译成 **OpenAI Chat Completions**。"
msgstr ""
"**OpenAI-compatible providers** (e.g. ``api.openai.com``, Zhipu ``paas/v4``, DeepSeek"
" ``/v1``): can serve both Claude Code and the Codex CLI. - When serving Claude Code, "
"the Gateway translates the **Anthropic Messages** requests it emits into **OpenAI "
"Chat Completions** in real time, and translates the returned SSE stream back. - When "
"serving the Codex CLI, the Gateway translates the **OpenAI Responses** requests into "
"**OpenAI Chat Completions**."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:202
msgid "添加供应商时需要选择正确的接口类型："
msgstr "When adding a provider, pick the correct interface type:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:204
msgid "若供应商提供 Anthropic Messages 协议（``/v1/messages``），选择 **Anthropic**。"
msgstr ""
"If the provider exposes the Anthropic Messages protocol (``/v1/messages``), choose "
"**Anthropic**."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:205
msgid "若供应商只提供 OpenAI Chat 协议（``/v1/chat/completions``），选择 **OpenAI 兼容**。"
msgstr ""
"If it only exposes the OpenAI Chat protocol (``/v1/chat/completions``), choose "
"**OpenAI-compatible**."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/cli-gateway.rst:37
msgid ""
"内置预设已覆盖常见供应商（Anthropic、DeepSeek、智谱、Kimi、MiniMax、火山引擎、OpenRouter、阿里百炼、Moonshot、SiliconFlow "
"等），可直接选用。"
msgstr ""
"Built-in presets cover common providers (Anthropic, DeepSeek, Zhipu, Kimi, MiniMax, Volcengine, "
"OpenRouter, Alibaba Bailian, Moonshot, SiliconFlow, and more) for direct selection."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:211
msgid "协议格式转换"
msgstr "Protocol format conversion"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:213
msgid "Gateway 在转发过程中会做以下转换，确保第三方模型的行为尽可能贴近原生体验："
msgstr ""
"While forwarding, the Gateway performs the following conversions so third-party "
"models behave as close to native as possible:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:215
msgid ""
"**请求方向**：``system`` 提示、``tools`` 工具定义、``tool_choice``、 ``thinking``（扩展思考，会映射为 "
"``reasoning_effort``）、``max_tokens`` 等都会按目标协议规范化。"
msgstr ""
"**Request direction**: ``system`` prompts, ``tools`` definitions, ``tool_choice``, "
"``thinking`` (extended thinking, mapped to ``reasoning_effort``), and ``max_tokens`` "
"are all normalized to the target protocol."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/cli-gateway.rst:45
msgid ""
"**响应方向**：第三方模型的 ``reasoning_content``（思考过程）会被翻译成 Anthropic 的 ``thinking`` 内容块；``tool_calls`` "
"会被翻译成 ``tool_use`` 内容块，保证 Claude Code 能正确识别工具调用（这是保证工具调用 / 多轮对话不中断的关键）。"
msgstr ""
"**Response direction**: a third-party model's ``reasoning_content`` (chain of thought) is "
"translated into Anthropic ``thinking`` content blocks; ``tool_calls`` are translated into "
"``tool_use`` blocks so Claude Code recognizes tool calls correctly (this is what keeps tool "
"calling and multi-turn conversations from breaking)."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/cli-gateway.rst:46
msgid ""
"**模型名映射**：Claude Code 发出的 ``claude-sonnet-*`` / ``claude-opus-*`` / ``claude-haiku-*`` / "
"``claude-fable-*`` 会自动映射为供应商配置的对应角色模型；``[1M]`` 等本地能力标记会在转发前剥离，避免泄漏给供应商。"
msgstr ""
"**Model-name mapping**: ``claude-sonnet-*`` / ``claude-opus-*`` / ``claude-haiku-*`` / ``claude-"
"fable-*`` from Claude Code are automatically mapped to the role models configured for the "
"provider; local capability markers such as ``[1M]`` are stripped before forwarding so they never "
"leak to the provider."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:227
msgid "故障转移与用量统计"
msgstr "Failover and usage statistics"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/cli-gateway.rst:51
msgid ""
"**故障转移**：可为 Claude 和 Codex 分别开启多供应商优先级，单点失败后自动切换到下一个候选供应商，并由断路器（circuit "
"breaker）抑制反复失败的上游。切换成功后会更新活跃供应商，UI 会同步反映。"
msgstr ""
"**Failover**: per-CLI (Claude and Codex) multi-provider priorities can be enabled; on failure the"
" gateway automatically falls back to the next candidate, while a circuit breaker suppresses "
"repeatedly failing upstreams. On a successful switch the active provider is updated and the UI "
"reflects it."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:232
msgid ""
"**用量统计**：面板按天展示请求趋势，区分 Claude 与 Codex 来源，支持 7 天 / 30 天 / 全部 筛选。会分别统计输入、输出、缓存读取、缓存写入 "
"token。"
msgstr ""
"**Usage statistics**: the panel shows daily request trends, split by Claude vs Codex "
"origin, with 7-day / 30-day / all filters. Input, output, cache-read, and cache-write"
" tokens are counted separately."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/cli-gateway.rst:53
msgid ""
"**费用估算**：定价来源优先级为 **自定义 > 远程（OpenRouter / LiteLLM）> 内置**，远程定价 24 小时缓存。对 Codex / OpenAI "
"兼容记录，会先从可计费输入中扣除缓存命中再计费，缓存读取单独计价。"
msgstr ""
"**Cost estimation**: pricing sources follow the priority **custom > remote (OpenRouter / LiteLLM)"
" > built-in**, with remote pricing cached for 24 hours. For Codex / OpenAI-compatible records, "
"cache hits are deducted from billable input before charging, and cache reads are priced "
"separately."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:237
msgid ""
"**状态栏**：启用 Gateway 后，VS Code 状态栏会显示 Gateway 端口及路由状态（Claude / Codex / Claude + "
"Codex），点击可打开后端状态菜单或回到配置页。"
msgstr ""
"**Status bar**: with the Gateway enabled, the VS Code status bar shows the gateway "
"port and routing state (Claude / Codex / Claude + Codex); clicking opens the backend "
"status menu or returns to the config page."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:240
msgid "Gateway 排错"
msgstr "Gateway troubleshooting"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/cli-gateway.rst:59
msgid ""
"**查看日志**：打开 ``AI CLI Gateway`` 输出通道，每行记录请求路径、上游地址、HTTP 状态码、耗时与模型名，形如 ``POST /v1/messages → 200 "
"(4183ms) [deepseek-v4-pro] [https://...]``。"
msgstr ""
"**View logs**: open the ``AI CLI Gateway`` output channel; every line records the request path, "
"upstream, HTTP status, latency, and model, e.g. ``POST /v1/messages → 200 (4183ms) "
"[deepseek-v4-pro] [https://...]``."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/cli-gateway.rst:60
msgid "日志显示 ``in:0 out:0``：表示该次响应未提取到 token 用量，常见于流式响应提前中断或上游未返回 usage 字段。"
msgstr ""
"Logs show ``in:0 out:0``: no token usage was extracted for that response — common with early-"
"aborted streaming responses or upstreams that omit the usage field."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/cli-gateway.rst:61
msgid "**请求中断 / 对话到一半停止**：通常是对话中触发了工具调用，但旧版本网关未正确翻译 ``tool_calls``。请确认使用的是已修复该问题的扩展版本。"
msgstr ""
"**Requests interrupted / conversations stop halfway**: usually a tool call was triggered mid-"
"conversation but an older gateway version failed to translate ``tool_calls`` correctly. Make sure"
" you are on an extension version with the fix."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/cli-gateway.rst:62
msgid "**403 key_model_access_denied**：上游拒绝该 API Key 访问请求的模型，说明模型名映射未生效或供应商未开通该模型权限，请在供应商卡片核对模型。"
msgstr ""
"**403 key_model_access_denied**: the upstream rejected this API key for the requested model — the"
" model-name mapping did not take effect, or the provider has not enabled that model; verify the "
"model on the provider card."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:251
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**手动校验健康状态**：``curl http://127.0.0.1:<port>/health`` 应返回 ``{\"ok\": true, ...}``。"
msgstr ""
"**Manual health check**: ``curl http://127.0.0.1:<port>/health`` should return "
"``{\"ok\": true, ...}``."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/configuration.rst:4
msgid "模型与后端配置"
