#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:268
msgid "在线工作空间中，在左侧文件树新建一个文件夹作为工作区（如 ``demo``），然后通过 ``File → Open Folder`` 打开。"
msgstr ""
"In the online workspace, create a new folder in the left file tree as your workspace "
"(e.g., ``demo``), then open it via ``File → Open Folder``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:271
