#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:441
msgid "**市场**：管理技能源，浏览并安装第三方技能。"
msgstr "**Marketplace**: Manage skill sources and browse and install third-party skills."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:442
