"directory, then enters a new project folder name. The extension shows the final path "
"and creates the directory without overwriting an existing project. They must enter "
"their own model keys before continuing."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/research-project.rst:95
