#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:6
msgid ""
"先区分问题发生在哪一层：平台负责启动开发环境，code-server 提供网页 IDE，AgentSociety 后端提供研究 API，模型供应商处理 LLM 请求。IDE "
"能打开，不代表后端和模型连接都已就绪。"
msgstr ""
"First identify the affected layer: the platform starts the development environment, code-server "
"provides the web IDE, the AgentSociety backend serves research APIs, and the model provider "
"handles LLM requests. An accessible IDE does not establish that the backend and model connection "
"are ready."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:491
msgid "code-server 显示 unhealthy"
msgstr "code-server shows unhealthy"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:11
msgid "**原因**：新工作空间需要启动 IDE 与配套进程，平台状态更新和服务就绪可能有短暂时间差。"
msgstr ""
"**Cause**: A new workspace must start the IDE and supporting processes. Platform status updates "
"and service readiness may briefly differ."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:13
msgid "**处理**：等待状态变为 Running 后重新进入。持续异常时查看工作空间启动日志，再重启该工作空间；模型 API Key 不会修复 IDE 启动问题。"
msgstr ""
"**Action**: Wait for Running and reopen the workspace. If the problem persists, inspect the "
"workspace startup logs before restarting it. A model API key cannot fix IDE startup problems."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:496
msgid "打开 code-server 后显示 502 错误"
msgstr "502 error when opening code-server"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:18
msgid "**原因**：访问网关暂时无法连接 IDE 服务。它与插件调用后端失败属于不同链路。"
msgstr ""
"**Cause**: The access gateway cannot currently reach the IDE service. This is a different "
"connection from the extension's backend requests."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:20
msgid "**处理**：先确认平台工作空间正在运行，再检查 IDE 启动日志。若 IDE 正常、只有技能或回放失败，转而查看插件的后端状态与 AI Social Scientist 输出日志。"
msgstr ""
"**Action**: Confirm that the platform workspace is running, then inspect the IDE startup logs. If"
" the IDE works but skills or replay fail, check backend status and the AI Social Scientist output"
" logs in the extension."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:501
msgid "本地 Python 环境路径问题"
msgstr "Local Python environment path issues"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:25
msgid "**原因**：终端使用的 Python 与扩展启动后端时使用的 Python 可能不是同一个；终端能导入 SDK，不代表扩展选择的解释器也装了 SDK。"
msgstr ""
"**Cause**: The terminal and extension may use different Python interpreters. Being able to import"
" the SDK in the terminal does not mean it is installed in the interpreter selected by the "
"extension."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:27
msgid "**处理**：在已安装 SDK 的环境中执行下列命令，将输出的解释器路径填入配置向导的后端服务步骤，再重新启动后端。"
msgstr ""
"**Action**: Run these commands in the environment where the SDK is installed. Enter the "
"interpreter path in the backend step of the configuration wizard, then restart the backend."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:29
msgid ""
"python -c \"import sys; print(sys.executable)\"\n"
"python -c \"from importlib.metadata import version; print(version('agentsociety2'))\""
msgstr ""
"python -c \"import sys; print(sys.executable)\"\n"
"python -c \"from importlib.metadata import version; print(version('agentsociety2'))\""

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:34
msgid "使用 uv 时，在项目目录把上面的 ``python`` 换成 ``uv run python``。安装与依赖要求见 :doc:`/installation`。"
msgstr ""
"With uv, replace ``python`` above with ``uv run python`` in the project directory. See "
":doc:`/installation` for installation and dependency requirements."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:37
msgid "模型连接成功，为什么运行时仍失败？"
msgstr "Why does a run fail after a successful model connection test?"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:39
msgid "**原因**：连接测试只能验证当次请求。实际任务还可能使用 Coder 或 Embedding 角色，依赖不同模型、协议、上下文长度与供应商额度。"
msgstr ""
"**Cause**: A connection test validates only that request. Actual tasks may also use Coder or "
"Embedding roles with different models, protocols, context limits, and provider quotas."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:41
msgid ""
"**处理**：按错误日志定位失败角色，核对对应模型 ID、协议和 API 配置。401/403 通常与凭据或权限有关，429 "
"通常与额度或速率有关；应同时阅读供应商返回的错误正文。重试不能修复无效凭据。"
msgstr ""
"**Action**: Identify the failing role from the logs and check its model ID, protocol, and API "
"settings. 401/403 commonly indicate credential or permission problems; 429 commonly indicates "
"quota or rate limits. Read the provider's error body as well. Retrying cannot repair invalid "
"credentials."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:43
msgid "配置项与推理控制说明见 :doc:`configuration`、:doc:`cli-gateway`；请求使用的模型以实际供应商配置为准。"
msgstr ""
"See :doc:`configuration` and :doc:`cli-gateway` for configuration and reasoning controls. The "
"actual provider configuration determines which model handles a request."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:513
msgid "实验运行失败"
msgstr "Experiment execution failed"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:48
msgid "先查看 ``run/output.log`` 中最早出现的错误，避免只根据最后一条汇总消息判断原因。"
msgstr ""
"Read the earliest error in ``run/output.log`` first instead of diagnosing from the final summary "
"message alone."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:50
msgid "**模块或参数错误**：核对 ``init/init_config.json`` 与所用模块的初始化参数；合法 JSON 仍可能包含错误的模块名或字段值。"
msgstr ""
"**Module or parameter errors**: Compare ``init/init_config.json`` with the selected module's "
"initialization parameters. Valid JSON can still contain an incorrect module name or field value."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:51
msgid "**内存不足**：先缩小智能体规模与单批任务量，再检查是否保留了过大的上下文或输入数据。减少总步数主要缩短运行与数据积累，不一定降低单步峰值内存。"
msgstr ""
"**Insufficient memory**: Reduce the agent population and batch size first, then inspect large "
"contexts and input data. Fewer total steps mainly reduce runtime and accumulated data; they do "
"not necessarily reduce peak memory within a step."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:52
msgid "**模型请求失败**：检查失败角色、协议、额度及供应商错误；不要把服务限流误判为实验配置错误。"
msgstr ""
"**Model request failures**: Check the failing role, protocol, quota, and provider error. Rate "
"limiting is not necessarily an experiment configuration problem."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:54
msgid "恢复运行前确认已有检查点；可用的恢复方式见 :doc:`/cli`。独立重跑使用新的输出目录，避免把两次实验的追加数据混在一起。"
msgstr ""
"Confirm that a checkpoint exists before resuming; see :doc:`/cli` for supported recovery. Use a "
"new output directory for an independent rerun so appended records from different runs are not "
"mixed."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:522
msgid "后端已启动，但回放没有数据"
msgstr "The backend is running, but replay has no data"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:59
msgid "**原因**：启动后端只提供 API，不会自动执行实验。回放依赖运行过程写出的数据集及其 catalog。"
msgstr ""
"**Cause**: Starting the backend only serves the API; it does not execute an experiment. Replay "
"requires datasets and their catalog to be written during a run."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:61
msgid ""
"**处理**：确认工作台选中的假设与实验，检查该实验的 ``run/replay/_schema.json`` 和 JSONL 分片。缺少 catalog "
"时先检查实验是否真正启动、是否启用了回放；有 catalog 但没有目标数据时，检查环境模块是否声明并写入了对应数据集。"
msgstr ""
"**Action**: Confirm the selected hypothesis and experiment, then inspect its "
"``run/replay/_schema.json`` and JSONL shards. If the catalog is missing, check whether the "
"experiment started and replay was enabled. If the catalog exists but the target data is absent, "
"check whether the environment module declares and writes that dataset."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:63
msgid "SDK 快速入门生成的独立目录可用 ``ReplayReader`` 读取；插件回放按研究工作区中的假设 / 实验目录定位数据。目录约定见 :doc:`/storage`。"
msgstr ""
"Use ``ReplayReader`` for the standalone directory generated by the SDK quickstart. Extension "
"replay locates data inside the research workspace's hypothesis and experiment directories. See "
":doc:`/storage` for directory conventions."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:66
msgid "API 返回 403、422 或 500"
msgstr "The API returns 403, 422, or 500"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst
msgid "按状态码定位问题"
msgstr "Diagnose by status code"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:71
msgid "**403**：查看响应正文。可能是 ``workspace_path`` 与后端绑定目录不一致，也可能是浏览器来源不受信任；切换项目后应重新绑定后端，不能只更换 URL 参数。"
msgstr ""
"**403**: Read the response body. The ``workspace_path`` may differ from the backend's bound "
"directory, or the browser origin may be untrusted. Rebind the backend after switching projects; "
"changing a URL parameter alone is insufficient."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:72
msgid "**422**：请求未通过参数校验。对照运行中 Swagger 的必填字段、类型及路径参数；它通常发生在业务逻辑执行前。"
msgstr ""
"**422**: Request parameter validation failed. Compare required fields, types, and path parameters"
" with the running Swagger documentation. This usually occurs before business logic runs."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:73
msgid "**500**：检查后端输出中的具体异常；未设置 ``WORKSPACE_PATH``、文件读取失败或运行时错误都可能导致此响应，状态码本身不能确定根因。"
msgstr ""
"**500**: Inspect the specific exception in backend output. An unset ``WORKSPACE_PATH``, a file "
"read failure, or another runtime error can produce this response; the status code alone does not "
"identify the cause."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:75
msgid "接口入口与只读请求示例见 :doc:`/api/http`。后端的 LLM API Key 只用于模型调用，不能替代后端访问配置。"
msgstr ""
"See :doc:`/api/http` for API access and read-only requests. The backend's LLM API key is used for"
" model calls and does not replace backend access configuration."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:78
msgid "为什么 ask 没推进时间，仍有日志和模型用量？"
msgstr "Why does ask produce logs and model usage without advancing time?"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:80
msgid ""
"``ask()`` 通过辅助器规划只读查询；只读约束指不允许调用环境写工具，不代表不调用模型或不记录日志。推进仿真时钟需要 ``step()`` 或 ``run()``；修改环境使用 "
"``intervene()``。具体工具取决于挂载的环境模块，见 :doc:`/interaction`。"
msgstr ""
"``ask()`` uses the helper to plan read-only queries. Read-only means environment write tools are "
"prohibited; model calls and logging can still occur. Use ``step()`` or ``run()`` to advance "
"simulation time, and ``intervene()`` to modify the environment. Available tools depend on the "
"mounted environment modules; see :doc:`/interaction`."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:83
msgid "tick=600 是要等十分钟吗？"
msgstr "Does tick=600 mean waiting ten minutes?"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:85
msgid "不是。``tick`` 表示每步推进的模拟秒数，真实耗时取决于模型延迟、智能体规模、工具和并发调度。两步、每步 600 秒表示模拟时间前进 20 分钟，不能据此推算机器运行时间。"
msgstr ""
"No. ``tick`` is the number of simulated seconds advanced per step. Wall-clock duration depends on"
" model latency, agent count, tools, and scheduling. Two 600-second steps advance simulated time "
"by 20 minutes; they do not determine the machine's runtime."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:88
msgid "为什么实验结束后没有分析报告？"
msgstr "Why is there no analysis report after the experiment finishes?"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:90
msgid "仿真执行与研究分析是两个阶段。运行结束产生原始记录；分析技能还需要读取数据、核对证据并生成图表与报告。先检查实验数据，再启动相应分析任务；报告位置与阶段说明见 :doc:`/results`。"
msgstr ""
"Simulation and research analysis are separate stages. A completed run produces raw records; the "
"analysis skill must then read data, check evidence, and generate figures and reports. Inspect "
"experiment data first, then start the appropriate analysis task. See :doc:`/results` for report "
"locations and stages."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide.rst:527
msgid "导入别人的工作区后无法运行"
msgstr "An imported workspace will not run"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:95
msgid "分享包不含模型密钥。请在配置页填写自己的 API Key，核对可用模型、Python 环境和自定义模块依赖，再启动后端。路径或模型名相同，也不代表双方环境与权限相同。"
msgstr ""
"Shared packages do not include model keys. Enter your own API key, verify available models, the "
"Python environment, and custom module dependencies, then start the backend. Identical paths or "
"model names do not establish identical environments or permissions."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:98
msgid "为什么同一配置两次结果不同？"
msgstr "Why do repeated runs with the same configuration differ?"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:100
msgid ""
"LLM 采样、上下文差异、供应商模型更新和并发执行都可能改变行为轨迹。记录模型 ID、采样参数、配置、输入数据、软件版本与重复次数，有助于判断差异来自方法还是运行条件。配置与离线检查示例见 "
":doc:`/examples`；复现实验应比较约定指标，不只比较逐字回答。"
msgstr ""
"LLM sampling, context differences, provider model updates, and concurrency can alter behavior "
"trajectories. Record model IDs, sampling parameters, configuration, input data, software "
"versions, and repetition counts to distinguish methodological differences from runtime "
"conditions. See :doc:`/examples` for configuration and offline checks. Compare defined metrics "
"when reproducing experiments, rather than only comparing exact answers."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/user_guide/troubleshooting.rst:102
msgid "更多 CLI 使用方法见 :doc:`/cli`，研究技能详见 :doc:`/skills`。"
msgstr "For more CLI usage, see :doc:`/cli`. For research skills, see :doc:`/skills`."
